# AI Features Documentation Rule

There is **no AI backend in this repository**. `apps/ai-backend` was removed. AI is served by the
standalone [`nuxeo-ai-package`](https://github.com/nuxeo/nuxeo-ai-package) Java marketplace bundle
on the Nuxeo server, called through the Automation API:

`POST /nuxeo/api/v1/automation/<OperationId>` with body `{ "params": { … } }`

The client is `AiGatewayService` (`libs/shared/ai-client/src/lib/ai-gateway.service.ts`); the base
URL is the `AI_BACKEND_URL` token, provided as `'/nuxeo'` in `apps/nuxeo-ui/src/app/app.config.ts`.
Do not look for `/ai/*` routes, an Express server, or port 3000 — none exist.

## Shipped AI features and the operations behind them

1. **Natural Language Search** — `AI.NlToNxql` (Search page + Admin NXQL page; `suggestions: true` drives autocomplete)
2. **Document Summarization** — `AI.Summarize` (Document Detail > AI Insights)
3. **AI Tag Suggestions** — `AI.SuggestTags` (Document Detail > AI Insights)
4. **Document Classification** — `AI.Classify` (Document Detail > AI Insights)
5. **Similar Documents** — `AI.Similar` (Document Detail > AI Insights)
6. **AI Chat Assistant** — `AI.Chat` (app header drawer; single request/response, not streaming)
7. **Dashboard AI Insights** — `AI.Insights` (Dashboard widget)
8. **Audit Anomaly Detection** — `AI.Anomalies` (Admin > Analytics, Admin > Audit)
9. **Audit NL Filter and Summary** — `AI.AuditNlFilter`, `AI.AuditSummarize` (Admin > Audit)
10. **Comment Sentiment Analysis** — `AI.Sentiment` (Document Detail comment thread)
11. **NL Permission Queries** — `AI.NlPermissions` (client method exists, no UI caller)

## When you change AI code

You MUST also update `docs/ai-features.md`, and `AGENTS.md` section 5 plus
`AGENTS/10-ai-features.md` if the operation list changes.

- Adding, removing or renaming an operation → update the feature section, the operation table and the Project Structure listing.
- Changing request/response shapes → update the examples in the relevant feature section and `ai.models.ts`.
- Adding a new AI feature → add a numbered section following the existing format.
- Never document model names here: model selection lives in `nuxeo-ai-package` and will drift.
- Never add a HAIP or model API key to this repo — see `AGENTS/07-security.md`.
